
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BANKDEMO.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 WS-BALANCE PIC 9(6) VALUE 5000.
       01 WS-AMOUNT  PIC 9(6) VALUE ZERO.
       01 WS-COUNT   PIC 9 VALUE ZERO.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       MAIN-LOGIC.

           DISPLAY 'BANK PROCESSING STARTED'.
           DISPLAY 'OPENING BALANCE: ' WS-BALANCE.

           MOVE 2000 TO WS-AMOUNT.
           PERFORM DEPOSIT-MONEY.

           MOVE 1500 TO WS-AMOUNT.
           PERFORM WITHDRAW-MONEY.

           MOVE 8000 TO WS-AMOUNT.
           PERFORM WITHDRAW-MONEY.

           DISPLAY 'FINAL BALANCE: ' WS-BALANCE.

           PERFORM VARYING WS-COUNT
               FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL WS-COUNT > 3

               DISPLAY 'REPORT NUMBER: ' WS-COUNT

           END-PERFORM.

           STOP RUN.

       DEPOSIT-MONEY.

           ADD WS-AMOUNT TO WS-BALANCE.

           DISPLAY 'DEPOSIT: ' WS-AMOUNT.
           DISPLAY 'BALANCE: ' WS-BALANCE.

       WITHDRAW-MONEY.

           IF WS-AMOUNT <= WS-BALANCE
               SUBTRACT WS-AMOUNT FROM WS-BALANCE
               DISPLAY 'WITHDRAWAL SUCCESS'
               DISPLAY 'BALANCE: ' WS-BALANCE
           ELSE
               DISPLAY 'INSUFFICIENT FUNDS'
           END-IF.
